tham kar apni kamar shey ne sada di abbas<br>
aye alamdar-e-jari aye mere bhai abbas<br>
<br>
1.haath katne pe bhi seene se tha mashikza laga<br>
bole shey khoob wafa tum ne nibhai abbas<br>
<br>
2.ab na akbar sa jawan la’al na humdum koi<br>
tumsa saathi nahi yawar nahi ghazi abbas<br>
<br>
3.nehr thi zere khadam tum rahi pyaase phir bhi<br>
hashr tak teri wafa yaad rahegi abbas<br>
<br>
4.jaan ko khuwaaish-e-baba nichawar karke<br>
aabroo haq-e-niyabath ki bachayi abbas<br>
<br>
5.kya kahun jaake sakina se kaha sarwar ne<br>
kya qayamath ki ghadi mujh pe ye aayi abbas<br>
<br>
6.laash pe hazrath-e-abbas ki shey kehte the<br>
mujhko tadpayegi ab teri judai abbas<br>
<br>
7.hyderi sher ho maskan bhi tarai payi<br>
khoob sone ki jagah tumne hai paayi abbas<br>
<br>
8.jab lahad nanhi si ek maine banai run mein<br>
yaad us waqt mujhe teri hai aayi abbas<br>
<br>
9.dekh kar sher ko aate huwe apni jaanib<br>
chodh kar bhaage layeen pal mein tarai abbas<br>
<br>
10.kis khadar zulm sahe tum ko bataun kya kya<br>
aaj aada ne kamar todi hai bhai abbas<br>
<br>
11.shah kehte the basad aaho fughan yeh sarwath<br>
kaun ab lega khabar aye mere bhai abbas